ode\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"reinserted OK\\n M LOGBOOK.md\\n M README.md\\n M internal/axpane/decide.go\\n?? internal/terminstance/\\n LOGBOOK.md                | 10 ++++++++++\\n README.md                 | 47 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n internal/axpane/decide.go |  5 ++++-\\n 3 files changed, 61 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 307,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 77,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
