ter receipt | `ExecuteMutating`, `InterimState` | `TestExecuteInterimState`, `TestExecuteReceiptPrecedesFirstEffect` |\n50|| Pre-effect errors restore source | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecutePreEffectErrorsRestoreSource` |\n51|| Post-commit uncertainty to unavailable | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecutePostEffectErrorsMoveUnavailable` |\n52|| Only quiesce enters quiescing | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteOnlyQuiesceEntersQuiescing` |\n53|| stale_fenced only via fencing | `ObserveFencing` | `TestObserveFencingStaleEpochFences`, `TestObserveFencingLeaseMismatchFences`, `TestObserveFencingNonStaleLeavesState` |\n54|| Per-effect auth+generation rechecks | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteRechecksBeforeEachEffect` |\n55|| Deadline cancels waiting only | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteDeadlineNeverCancelsCommittedEffect`, `TestExecuteEntryDeadlineCodes` |\n56|\n57|## Generation-safe evidence (§4.B, §7.A)\n58|\n59|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n60|| --- | --- | --- |\n61|| Bound in every owned surface | parse/check entries | rows 26, 36, 39 tests |\n62|| Stale refuses landed stale class | `ExecuteMutating` | entry + per-effect staleness tests |\n63|| Verdict agrees with landed digest | `checkGenerationBound` | `TestGenerationBoundAgreesWithLandedDigest` |\n64|| Row codes admitted by landed table | `CheckErrorAllowed` | `TestRowCodesAreAdmittedByCheckErrorAllowed` |\n65|| Descriptor bound | landed `terminalbackend` | cited landed (checkGeneration arms) |\n66|\n67|## Operation rows (§4.C, §5.2)\n68|\n69|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n70|| --- | --- | --- |\n71|| status same-state all 8, zero effects | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusAllSources`, `TestExecuteStatusAdoptsReportedState` |\n72|| status non-match adopts absent | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusNonMatchAdoptsAbsent` |\n73|| status unknown never absent | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusUnknownIsNeverAbsent` |\n74|| status report validation | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusReportValidation`, `TestExecuteStatusMatchedTupleFalseFormRefuses` |\n75|| status conditionals + session scope | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusProviderConditional`, `TestExecuteStatusSessionScoped` |\n76|| quiesce rows + refusal set | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteQuiesceSuccess`, `TestExecuteBackendRowErrorSets` |\n77|| wait rows + capabilities | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteWaitSuccess`, `TestExecuteWaitCapabilityConditionals` |\n78|| stop rows + order | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteStopSuccess` |\n79|| create receipt rule | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteCreateReceiptRule` |\n80|| Replay, mismatch, uncertain retry | `ExecuteMutating`, `ReceiptStore` | `TestExecuteIdenticalRetryReplays`, `TestExecuteChangedOperationInWindowMismatches`, `TestExecuteUncertainRetryRequiresStatus` |\n81|| Crash seam + status recovery | `ReceiptStore`, `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteCrashChildSelfTerminates` |\n82|| Conferral wiring + scope gate | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteEmptyAdmittedRefusesAtLandedGate`, `TestExecuteScopeGate` |\n83|\n84|## Negative-evidence index (narrowing mutants)\n85|\n86|53/53 harness rows: 51 narrowing KILLED + 1 tightening edge KILLED\n87|+ control (`mutants/pass1/`, `mutants/pass2/` with raw per-plant\n88|logs both passes). One narrowing mutant per auth arm\n89|(`N-auth-*`), per mapping arm (`N-disp-*`), per enum\n90|(`N-proof-*`, `N-disp-parse`), per key/generation/timeout arm\n91|(`N-context-*`, `N-body-key`, `N-wait-timeout-bound`), per\n92|repetition member (8× `N-result-*`), per order/unique half\n93|(`N-result-effects-order`, `N-result-evidence-unique`), per\n94|receipt gate (`N-store-*`, `N-complete-unbound`), per fencing\n95|arm (`N-fencing-*`), per engine gate (`N-engine-*`,\n96|`N-status-nullpair`, `N-interim`), and the `C-control` SURVIVED\n97|control (see TRACEABILITY.md mutant table).","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
