{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e6a7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b232-ed9f-73f2-b41b-df749face5b0"},"sequence":4526,"recorded_at":1780531400009047,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"5f437c29-0343-41ba-a118-050af5991fa2","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"5f437c29-0343-41ba-a118-050af5991fa2","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"5f437c29-0343-41ba-a118-050af5991fa2"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — handed off to review.\n\nTASK-260830-kkh1an is `to-review` (checklist 14/14, three outcome resources attached). The candidate is the uncommitted worktree on the refreshed Story branch (HEAD `c61fc06`, base trunk `c3aae73`).\n\nWhat this run did: refreshed the candidate onto trunk (`refresh_advanced` with LOGBOOK replay; 29 stale paths restored, config byte-identical), inherited the rev1 delta verbatim, and re-verified it against SPEC.v0.7.0 and the landed owners. Fixes closed: age-gated the staging sweep (concurrent `Bind` could lose its live stage), corrected the §13.1 drift claim, added the missing create-deadline / first-effect-`stop_timeout` / Go-version / report-member pins, and rowed 17 previously unmeasured gates (kind mapping, fencing operation, timeout codes, status source, six `checkParams` arms, version delegation, body scope/member-set, sweep age, both wire-order sorts).\n\nEvidence: 72 of 72 AC rows driven (70 named tests present, 7 subtests passed); mutant harness 70/70 on two identical passes (68 narrowing + 1 tightening KILLED, control SURVIVED, per-plant raw logs both passes, blobs identical); full 30-command suite green (race gate in 7 bounded chunks, 40/40 packages, no DATA RACE; terminstance 83.8% cover; tracecheck trunk figures unchanged); real-gzip task-scoped archive with a verified manifest and no `__pycache__`.","reason":null}}
